      {
        "subject": "Part 340010 - binding 24-month proposal",
        "body": "Dear Ms Zellner,\n\nWe propose EUR 29.89/unit for a binding 23,400/year, 24 months and 56 days.\n\nOur buyer estimate is EUR 24.31/unit excluding margin, with 5% uncertainty (cost:340010); it is our estimate, not your actual cost.\n\nWould you sponsor this package for manager approval if needed? We would gladly support your business case with the firm commitment.\n\nKind regards, Hollerau Purchasing",
        "term_sheets": [
          {
            "terms": {
              "unit_price": 29.89,
              "volume_per_year": 23400,
              "contract_months": 24,
              "lead_time_days": 56
            }
          }
        ],
        "from": "buyer"
      },
      {
        "from": "sup:70410",
        "body": "Dear Sir or Madam,\n\nWe have reviewed your offer and can adjust our Angebot as follows. We checked the should cost data you cited; it holds and we took it into account. We acknowledge your request for an increased volume of 23,400 units over a 24-month contract term. \n\nIn consideration of these parameters and the 56-day lead time, we can offer a revised price of €31.80 per unit. For clarity, our offer comprises a price of €31.80 per unit, Lieferzeit 56 days, a volume of 23400 pcs per year, and a contract term of 24 months. This offer remains valid for 30 days.\n\nMit freundlichen Grüßen\nMonika Zellner\nSegment Manager, Dichtungswerk Ravensteiner GmbH",
        "status": "open",
        "term_sheets": [
          {
            "term_sheet_id": "offer:70410-1",
            "terms": {
              "unit_price": 31.8,
              "lead_time_days": 56,
              "volume_per_year": 23400,
              "contract_months": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "signals": {
          "reply_delay_days": 2,
          "validity_days": 30
        },
        "claim_results": [
