      },
      {
        "subject": "Seal 24 mm: revised proposal with third committed year",
        "body": "Dear Ms Zellner,\n\nThank you for your revised quote. We raise our proposal to EUR 30.90 and add a third committed year: 23,400/year, 36 months and 56 days.\n\nSupplier-wide on-time delivery was 79.5% (sc:70410@2026Q3); we ask for commercial recognition of this service record. We would conclude on this complete package.\n\nIf approval is needed, we would be glad to support your business case.\n\nKind regards, Hollerau Purchasing",
        "term_sheets": [
          {
            "terms": {
              "unit_price": 30.9,
              "volume_per_year": 23400,
              "contract_months": 36,
              "lead_time_days": 56
            }
          }
        ],
        "from": "buyer"
      },
      {
        "from": "sup:70410",
        "body": "Dear Sir or Madam,\n\nWe note your proposal for a 36-month contract and an annual volume of 23,400 units. The delivery record you referenced has been reviewed but does not justify your proposed price. \n\nWe can accommodate these extended terms at a revised unit price of €31.60. Our Angebot consists of a price of €31.60 per unit, Lieferzeit 56 days, a volume of 23400 pcs per year, and a contract term of 36 months. \n\nThis is our final offer (letztes Angebot). Please decide. Our offer remains valid for 7 days.\n\nMit freundlichen Grüßen\nMonika Zellner\nSegment Manager, Dichtungswerk Ravensteiner GmbH",
        "status": "final_offer",
        "term_sheets": [
          {
            "term_sheet_id": "offer:70410-2",
            "terms": {
              "unit_price": 31.6,
              "lead_time_days": 56,
              "volume_per_year": 23400,
